{"id":"460087","name":"玉米笋墨鱼老鸭汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/460087/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"墨鱼","amount":"一只"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"几粒"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好鸭子，清洗干净。","img":"images/460087/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅，加姜片和葱焯水。","img":"images/460087/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备好墨鱼和玉米笋，墨鱼提前泡发好。","img":"images/460087/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"墨鱼切大块。","img":"images/460087/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸭子肉过凉水清洗干净。","img":"images/460087/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸭肉和墨鱼转入电高压锅。","img":"images/460087/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加姜片压30分钟。","img":"images/460087/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/460087/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入玉米笋，再次烧开，加盐和鸡精、胡椒粉调味，加枸杞和葱段。","img":"images/460087/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅。","img":"images/460087/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}